{"id":"192242ff132fc1ff","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dce-field.md","title":"Field Closure of D.c.e. Reals","display":"thm-dce-field — Field Closure of D.c.e. Reals","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dce-field","aliases":["43-thm-dce-field"],"display":"thm-dce-field — Field Closure of D.c.e. Reals","depends_on":["[[43-df-dce-real]]","[[43-thm-dce-bounded-variation]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 8.5.4","source_printed_pages":"152–153","source_pdf_pages":"172–173","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dce-field"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dce-field</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dce-field — Field Closure of D.c.e. Reals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2485b90ec527f97e\" href=\"?note=2485b90ec527f97e\" title=\"43-df-dce-real\">43-df-dce-real</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"87a029d02ac0983e\" href=\"?note=87a029d02ac0983e\" title=\"43-thm-dce-bounded-variation\">43-thm-dce-bounded-variation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 8.5.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"152–153"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"172–173"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DCEReal}\">\\(\\mathrm{DCEReal}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2485b90ec527f97e\" href=\"?note=2485b90ec527f97e\" title=\"43-df-dce-real\">43-df-dce-real</a>。倒数项的变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> 上量化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DCEReal}(0)\\land\\mathrm{DCEReal}(1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DCEReal}(0)\\land\\mathrm{DCEReal}(1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\land\\mathrm{DCEReal}(y)\\bigr)\\implies\\bigl(\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x+y)\\land\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x-y)\\land\\mathrm{DCEReal}(xy)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\land\\mathrm{DCEReal}(y)\\bigr)\\implies\\bigl(\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x+y)\\land\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x-y)\\land\\mathrm{DCEReal}(xy)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall z\\in\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DCEReal}(z)\\implies\\mathrm{DCEReal}(z^{-1})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall z\\in\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DCEReal}(z)\\implies\\mathrm{DCEReal}(z^{-1})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>加减法可直接重排左 c.e. 差分。也可统一使用有界变差刻画：若有理近似 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_s,q_s\">\\(p_s,q_s\\)</span> 的变差有限，则两序列有界，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|p_{s+1}q_{s+1}-p_sq_s|\\le |p_{s+1}|\\,|q_{s+1}-q_s|+|q_s|\\,|p_{s+1}-p_s|\">\\(|p_{s+1}q_{s+1}-p_sq_s|\\le |p_{s+1}|\\,|q_{s+1}-q_s|+|q_s|\\,|p_{s+1}-p_s|\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_s\\to z\\ne0\">\\(q_s\\to z\\ne0\\)</span>，可固定某个有限阶段后使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|q_s|\\ge\\delta&gt;0\">\\(|q_s|\\ge\\delta&gt;0\\)</span>；删去此前有限段后，倒数近似满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|q_{s+1}^{-1}-q_s^{-1}|\\le\\delta^{-2}|q_{s+1}-q_s|\">\\(|q_{s+1}^{-1}-q_s^{-1}|\\le\\delta^{-2}|q_{s+1}-q_s|\\)</span>。这是存在性论证，无须统一计算出该阶段或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 8.5.4；印刷页 152–153，PDF 页 172–173。本轮核对范围及证明限制如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-dce-real","status":"resolved","id":"2485b90ec527f97e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dce-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-dce-bounded-variation","status":"resolved","id":"87a029d02ac0983e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-dce-bounded-variation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dce-real","status":"resolved","id":"2485b90ec527f97e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]。倒数项的变量 $z$ 仅在 $\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\}$ 上量化。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DCEReal}","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DCEReal}(0)\\land\\mathrm{DCEReal}(1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\land\\mathrm{DCEReal}(y)\\bigr)\\implies\\bigl(\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x+y)\\land\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x-y)\\land\\mathrm{DCEReal}(xy)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall z\\in\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DCEReal}(z)\\implies\\mathrm{DCEReal}(z^{-1})\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"p_s,q_s","display":false},{"tex":"|p_{s+1}q_{s+1}-p_sq_s|\\le |p_{s+1}|\\,|q_{s+1}-q_s|+|q_s|\\,|p_{s+1}-p_s|","display":false},{"tex":"q_s\\to z\\ne0","display":false},{"tex":"|q_s|\\ge\\delta>0","display":false},{"tex":"|q_{s+1}^{-1}-q_s^{-1}|\\le\\delta^{-2}|q_{s+1}-q_s|","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false}],"bytes":1791,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-dce-field]] — Field Closure of D.c.e. Reals"},{"id":"4c3fe677631170c2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书 Theorem 8.5.8 的“实闭”在嵌入实数域的情形可表为对全部实代数根封闭；与 [[43-thm-dce-field]] 合起来给出实闭子域性质。零次非零多项式没有根，故边界情形不制造见证。该节证明使用分析函数的根与有界变差近似；此处核对最终陈述及多项式应用段，没有逐行核验所有 Newton 迭代引理。"}],"outgoing":["2485b90ec527f97e","87a029d02ac0983e"]}